BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Engagement Station - Willowdale Summer Environment Day 2026
DTSTART:20260711T140000Z
DTEND:20260711T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260705T082914Z
UID:f4332e51-7476-5547-b845-94099f65e0f8
DESCRIPTION:We are hosting a Bike Engagement Station at Willowdale Summer 
 Environment Day on Saturday\, July 11. We'll be there with some educationa
 l materials and will demonstrate how to perform safety checks for those wh
 o may not have access to a bike shop but want to get riding. We'll be able
  to help with things like inflating your tires\, lubricating your chain\, 
 demonstrating how to do an (https://www.cycleto.ca/abccheck) ABC safety ch
 eck\, and anything else our teams can safely accomplish in a few minutes.\
 n\nSee the details below:\n\n* Date: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\n* Time: 10
 :00 am - 2:00 pm\n* Location: 6464 Yonge St\, North York M2M 3X4 (Center P
 oint Mall Parking Lot)\n\nBike Month is a month long celebration of cyclin
 g across Toronto. Join us on community rides\, learn more about the joys o
 f cycling or visit one of our bike engagement stations. Visit (https://www
 .cycleto.ca/toronto.ca/bikemonth) toronto.ca/bikemonth.\n\nSee you there!\
 nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/engagement_station_willowdale_summer_environm
 ent_day_20260711
LOCATION:Centrepoint Mall North Parking Lot\n6464 Yonge St\nNorth York ON 
 M2M 3X4\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/engagement_station_willowdale_summer_environmen
 t_day_20260711
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
